        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <FAQSection items={faqItems} lang="en" />

    <section class="section section--cta" aria-labelledby="bottom-cta-heading" id="contact">
      <h2 id="bottom-cta-heading">Get Free Legal Advice on Divorce in Abu Dhabi</h2>
      <p>Speak to a qualified Abu Dhabi family lawyer within 24 hours. Completely confidential. English and Arabic support.</p>
      <LeadForm lang="en" variant="inline" />
    </section>

  </main>

